"uniprot":["Q96I13"],"ncbi_summary":"This gene is upstream of, and in a head-to-head orientation with the gene for the mitochondrial ribosomal protein L34. The predicted protein contains alpha/beta hydrolase fold and secretory lipase domains. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2008].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q96I13","text":"Negatively regulates NLRP3-driven inflammation (PubMed:39225180). Promotes NLRP3 degradation through the chaperone-mediated autophagy (CMA) pathway, hence attenuating inflammasome activation and IL1B secretion. Acts by recruiting palmitoyltransferase ZDHHC12 to NLRP3, facilitating NLRP3 palmitoylation and subsequent degradation (PubMed:39225180)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}